<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
     Device framework configuration for the OPPO A5s (CPH1909).

     Extracted from the stock OPPO CPH1909 (Android 8.1 / ColorOS 5.2)
     framework-res.apk.  See overlay/README.md for the provenance, the
     full accounting and the list of stock values that are deliberately
     excluded.

     The extracted sections read the stock ColorOS 8.1
     framework-res.apk and keep only resources that LineageOS 17.1
     still defines.  The final section adds device capabilities that
     the stock framework config does not attest; the README records
     the evidence for each.  Resources whose 8.1 value is ROM policy
     rather than device configuration are listed there too.
-->
